<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Tourist Places in Tanjore</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: white;
            background: url("https://png.pngtree.com/background/20250108/original/pngtree-take-a-look-at-this-beautiful-prambanan-temple-picture-image_15628658.jpg") no-repeat center center fixed;
            background-size: cover;
        }
        header {
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in;
        }
        section {
            padding: 20px 50px;
            animation: fadeIn 2.5s ease-in;
        }
        .place {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            animation: slideUp 1.5s ease forwards;
        }
        .place:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .place:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
        .place:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.9s; }
        .place:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
        .place:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 1.5s; }
        .place:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 1.8s; }

        .place img {
            width: 250px;
            height: 180px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-right: 20px;
            border: 3px solid white;
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }
        .place img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }
        .place div {
            max-width: 700px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .place:hover div {
            transform: translateX(10px);
        }
        .place h2 {
            color: yellow;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            padding: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
            animation: fadeIn 3s ease-in;
        }
        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            padding: 12px 25px;
            margin: 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            background: #fff;
            color: #c0392b;
        }

        /* Animations */
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }
        @keyframes slideUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Tourist Places in Tanjore</h1>
    </header>

    <section>
        <div class="place">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSTdiy99k8x3f4qUptxh5-MPjrKpu68KwtKxA&s" alt="Brihadeeswarar Temple">
            <div>
                <h2>Brihadeeswarar Temple</h2>
                <p>A UNESCO World Heritage site built by Raja Raja Chola I, known for its grand architecture and spiritual significance.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="place">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQY4cL4hDVb8hSLCbvp9MPw_xdTrUf6jT4jIQ&s" alt="Maratha Palace">
            <div>
                <h2>Thanjavur Maratha Palace</h2>
                <p>Historic palace featuring museums, art galleries, and the Saraswathi Mahal Library, reflecting Maratha architecture.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="place">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSXA9w2rAOwieLQ9AbbEKjs7dkUzqHcIyg4Cg&s" alt="Saraswathi Mahal Library">
            <div>
                <h2>Saraswathi Mahal Library</h2>
                <p>One of the oldest libraries in Asia, housing rare manuscripts, palm leaf records, and ancient texts.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="place">
            <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Schwartz Church">
            <div>
                <h2>Schwartz Church</h2>
                <p>A church built in 1779 by Raja Serfoji II in memory of Christian missionary Rev. Schwartz.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="place">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSH9sG3k-XoGvJUBxGJP4SZsX5Z12Qq2sthlQ&s" alt="Gangaikonda Cholapuram">
            <div>
                <h2>Gangaikonda Cholapuram</h2>
                <p>A grand temple built by Rajendra Chola I, showcasing Chola dynasty's rich art and architecture.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="place">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRaNqQbIvyU02ExXqpv0wIHUXntJTe86ltRPA&s" alt="Alangudi Guru Temple">
            <div>
                <h2>Alangudi Guru Temple</h2>
                <p>A famous Navagraha temple dedicated to Lord Guru (Jupiter), attracting thousands of devotees each year.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="gallery.html">Gallery</a>
        <a href="hotel.html">Hotel Booking</a>
        <a href="places.html">Tourist Places</a>
    </nav>
</body>
</html>
